2	line	Player	I'm afraid I don't have it with me.
2	line	Chamber guardian	Once you have your cape come back to me, and I shall supply you with a mage staff ready for battle.
2	action	end
1	cond	If the player has the cape with them:
2	line	Chamber guardian	Good, good, I hope you have chosen well. I will now present you with a magic staff. This, along with the cape awarded to you by your chosen god, are all the weapons and armour you will need here.
