1	line	Player	Hello, Kolodion.
1	line	Kolodion	Hey there, how are you? Are you enjoying the bloodshed?
1	select	Select an Option
1	option	I think I've had enough for now.
2	line	Player	I think I've had enough for now.
2	line	Kolodion	A shame. You're a good battle mage. I hope to see you soon.
2	action	end
1	option	How can I use my new spells outside of the arena?
2	line	Player	How can I use my new spells outside of the arena?
2	line	Kolodion	Experience, my friend, experience. Once you've used the spell enough times in the arena, you'll be able to use them in the rest of Gielinor.
2	line	Player	Good stuff.
2	line	Kolodion	Not so good for the citizens; they won't stand a chance.
2	line	Player	How am I doing so far?
2	cond	If player has cast Saradomin Strike (unknown) times:
3	line	Kolodion	You still need to train with the strike spell inside the arena before you can use it outside.
2	cond	If player has cast Saradomin Strike (unknown) times:
3	line	Kolodion	You have completed over half of the training needed to use the strike spell outside of the arena.
2	cond	If player has cast Saradomin Strike (unknown) times:
3	line	Kolodion	You are almost ready to use the strike spell outside of the arena.
2	cond	If player has cast Saradomin Strike at least 100 times:
3	line	Kolodion	You're experienced enough to use the strike spell anywhere.
2	cond	If player has cast Claws of Guthix (unknown) times:
