2	cond	If player has cast Claws of Guthix (unknown) times:
3	line	Kolodion	You are almost ready to use the claw spell outside of the arena.
2	cond	If player has cast Claws of Guthix at least 100 times:
3	line	Kolodion	You're experienced enough to use the claw spell anywhere.
2	cond	If player has cast Flames of Zamorak (unknown) times:
